# No live generation

Never set `GOLF_LIVE`. Never run a live generation eval. Never make Anthropic API calls.

Retrieval scripts and `evaluate.py` use OpenAI embeddings only. Those may run. Generation stays in replay mode unless the user has already set `GOLF_LIVE=1` themselves and explicitly asks for a live run.
